"bg-[#C4622D] text-white text-xs px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full tracking-wider sweep-btn\" style=\"--sweep-bg:#5C2D0E\">Add</button></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#EDD9B8]/60\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full mb-4 bg-[#EDD9B8]\"></div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-1\">Ethiopia · Yirgacheffe</p><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight mb-1 text-[#2B1608]\">Pour Over</h4><p class=\"text-xs leading-5 mb-4 font-light text-[#5C2D0E]/60\">Floral, bright, jasmine</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-base font-medium text-[#2B1608]\">$7.00</span><button class=\"bg-[#C4622D] text-white text-xs px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full tracking-wider sweep-btn\" style=\"--sweep-bg:#5C2D0E\">Add</button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-[#EDD9B8]/60\"><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-6 sm:mb-8\">Badges &amp; Tags</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><span class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase border border-[#2B1608]/20 text-[#2B1608] bg-[#2B1608]/5\">Single Origin</span><span class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase border border-[#2B1608]/20 text-[#2B1608] bg-[#2B1608]/5\">Small Batch</span><span class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase border border-[#2B1608]/20 text-[#2B1608] bg-[#2B1608]/5\">Ethically Sourced</span><span class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase border border-[#C4622D] text-[#C4622D] bg-[#C4622D]/5\">Light Roast</span><span class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase border border-[#C4622D] text-[#C4622D] bg-[#C4622D]/5\">Seasonal</span></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"reveal \"><section><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium tracking-tight shrink-0\">05 — Page Layouts</p><div class=\"flex-1 h-px bg-[#EDD9B8]\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-4\"><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-3\">Navbar — wordmark</p><div class=\"bg-[#2B1608] rounded-2xl px-5 sm:px-10 py-4 sm:py-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><img src=\"/logo-horizontal.png\" alt=\"Taïga\" class=\"h-8 sm:h-10 object-contain brightness-0 invert shrink-0\"/><div class=\"hidden sm:flex gap-8\"><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/70 text-sm cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700\">Menu</span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/70 text-sm cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700\">Story</span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/70 text-sm cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700\">Brew</span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/70 text-sm cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700\">Find us</span></div><button class=\"bg-[#C4622D] text-[#EDD9B8] px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 sm:py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs shrink-0\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px\">Order</button></div></div><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-3\">Hero — black mark as watermark</p><div class=\"bg-[#2B1608] rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"min-height:300px\"><img src=\"/logo-mark-black.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute -right-16 -bottom-8 brightness-0 invert opacity-[0.07]\" style=\"height:340px\"/><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-end h-full p-6 sm:p-12\" style=\"min-height:300px\"><img src=\"/logo-wordmark.png\" alt=\"Taïga\" class=\"h-5 object-contain object-left brightness-0 invert mb-6 opacity-50\" style=\"width:120px\"/><h2 class=\"text-[#EDD9B8] leading-none mb-5 text-4xl sm:text-6xl\">Where the wild<br/>meets the cup.</h2><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><div class=\"bg-[#C4622D] text-white px-5 sm:px-7 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-full text-xs\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px\">Explore menu</div><div class=\"border border-[#EDD9B8]/30 text-[#EDD9B8] px-5 sm:px-7 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-full text-xs\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px\">Our story</div></div></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-3\">Values strip — amber mark as icon</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8]/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8\"><img src=\"/logo-mark-amber.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-10 w-16 object-contain object-left mb-5\"/><h3 class=\"text-[#2B1608] mb-2\">Direct Trade</h3><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/60 text-sm leading-6 font-light\">We work directly with farmers in Costa Rica, paying above fair-trade prices.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8]/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8\"><img src=\"/logo-mark-amber.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-10 w-16 object-contain object-left mb-5\"/><h3 class=\"text-[#2B1608] mb-2\">Small Batch</h3><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/60 text-sm leading-6 font-light\">Roasted fresh to order so every bag you receive is at peak flavour.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8]/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8\"><img src=\"/logo-mark-amber.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-10 w-16 object-contain object-left mb-5\"/><h3 class=\"text-[#2B1608] mb-2\">Come As You Are</h3><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/60 text-sm leading-6 font-light\">A space for everyone. Great coffee doesn&#x27;t need a dress code.</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-3\">About strip — horizontal lockup</p><div class=\"bg-[#FAF6F0] border border-[#EDD9B8]/60 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center\"><img src=\"/logo-horizontal.png\" alt=\"Taïga Pura Vida Coffee\" class=\"h-14 sm:h-20 object-contain\"/><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/70 text-base leading-7 max-w-xl font-light\">Born in the wild, brewed with intention. Every cup is a small act of pura vida — pure life — shared between the land, the farmer, and you.</p></div></div><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-3\">CTA section — cream mark on dark</p><div class=\"bg-[#2B1608] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6\"><img src=\"/logo-mark-cream.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute -left-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-20 hidden sm:block\" style=\"height:260px\"/><div class=\"relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3\">Ready to visit?</p><h2 class=\"text-[#EDD9B8] text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Come find us.</h2></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 items-start sm:items-end\"><button class=\"bg-[#EDD9B8] text-[#2B1608] px-6 sm:px-8 py-3 sm:py-3.5 rounded-full\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px\">Get directions</button><p class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/40 text-xs tracking-wider\">123 Jungle St, San José, CR</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-3\">Footer — square lockup</p><div class=\"bg-[#2B1608] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6 sm:gap-0 sm:justify-between\"><img src=\"/logo-square-brown.png\" alt=\"Taïga\" class=\"h-14 w-14 sm:h-20 sm:w-20 object-contain brightness-0 invert opacity-80\"/><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 sm:gap-10\"><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/50 text-xs cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase\">Menu</span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/50 text-xs cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase\">Story</span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/50 text-xs cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase\">Brew</span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/50 text-xs cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase\">Find us</span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/50 text-xs cursor-pointer hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase\">Instagram</span></div><p class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/25 text-xs\">© 2026 Taïga</p></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"reveal \"><section><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium tracking-tight shrink-0\">06 — Spacing &amp; Shape</p><div class=\"flex-1 h-px bg-[#EDD9B8]\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-[#EDD9B8]/60\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10 sm:gap-16\"><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-6\">Border Radius</p><div class=\"space-y-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><div class=\"w-20 h-10 bg-[#2B1608] rounded-full shrink-0\"></div><div><p class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-sm font-medium\">Buttons / Badges</p><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/40 text-xs\">9999px</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><div class=\"w-20 h-10 bg-[#2B1608] rounded-2xl shrink-0\"></div><div><p class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-sm font-medium\">Cards / Panels</p><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/40 text-xs\">16px</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><div class=\"w-20 h-10 bg-[#2B1608] rounded-lg shrink-0\"></div><div><p class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-sm font-medium\">Inputs / Small elements</